<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8015" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Cĭmĭnus</span></b> , i,
			m., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				lake in Etruria</i>, <i>near Sutrium</i>, now <i>Lago di Vico</i>, or <i>di
			Ronciglione</i>, <i>with a mountain forest lying near
				it</i>, <i><span class="en">Verg. A. 7, 697</span></i>.—Hence, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Cĭmĭnĭus</span></b> , a,
			um, adj., <i>Ciminian</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lacus,</span>”
				i.e. <i>Ciminus</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					8, 16, 2</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">silva,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv. 9, 36, 1 sq.</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">10, 24, 5</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Plin.
				2, 96, 98, § 211</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">saltus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					9, 36, 6</span></i>
			; cf. <i><span class="en">Flor. 1, 17, 2</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mons,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					9, 36, 11</span></i>
			.—As <i>subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Cĭ-mĭnĭa</span></b> ,
			ae, f., <i>the region about
				Lake Ciminus</i>, <i><span class="en">Amm. 17, 7,
		13</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
